      <details><summary>How do I book?</summary><div class="answer">Message us on WhatsApp with your date and group size. We confirm availability, arrange payment, and once paid we send the boarding address.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How much does it cost?</summary><div class="answer">Residents: adults S/179, children (2–12) S/149, infants free (1 per family). Visitors: adults US$69, students US$59, children US$49. The SERNANP fee is paid separately.</div></details>
