      <details><summary>How long is it?</summary><div class="answer">Approximately 3 to 4 hours. Departures are by reservation, with no fixed schedule.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Where do we board?</summary><div class="answer">From our private pier in La Punta, Callao. The exact address is shared once your booking is confirmed. <span class="pending">{{ t.pending }} (B10)</span></div></details>
